      "en": "He said to the disciples, “It is impossible that no occasions of stumbling should come, but woe to him through whom they come!",
      "ko": "예수께서 제자들에게 이르시되 실족케 하는 것이 없을 수는 없으나 있게 하는 자에게는 화로다",
      "source_text_hash": "c1f47f518b22508611f5d8ce7ca9e2c692a7e86d4e90a8acd11fe3d6a9717349",
      "translation_text_hash": "c20422a2288b9caeb531120f6f2f8a452410cba346dcfee08719912eefdb573f",
