        {
          "book": "LUK",
          "chapter": 17,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "It would be better for him if a millstone were hung around his neck, and he were thrown into the sea, rather than that he should cause one of these little ones to stumble.",
      "ko": "저가 이 작은 자 중에 하나를 실족케 할찐대 차라리 연자맷돌을 그 목에 매이우고 바다에 던지우는 것이 나으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "72df8c12fb334b2145c75274708386dd6ace476d068158304982cb2bbfc588c3",
      "translation_text_hash": "71388a2a09e3167419c8d3fc795fe29f74286ed05543227691d4ad8ce9e1da2b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
