      "en": "If he sins against you seven times in the day, and seven times returns, saying, ‘I repent,’ you shall forgive him.”",
      "ko": "만일 하루 일곱번이라도 네게 죄를 얻고 일곱번 네게 돌아와 내가 회개하노라 하거든 너는 용서하라 하시더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8977201db6cb16a3d2a511bbf276824a71ce123b42693be9e9196d80cbcab110",
      "translation_text_hash": "d10dc82fed48292218e5364458f5deb4ac630ba2ba4e9680fc8a4fbd3c0c9eb2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
