      "en": "But who is there among you, having a servant plowing or keeping sheep, that will say when he comes in from the field, ‘Come immediately and sit down at the table’?",
      "ko": "너희 중에 뉘게 밭을 갈거나 양을 치거나 하는 종이 있어 밭에서 돌아 오면 저더러 곧 와 앉아서 먹으라 할 자가 있느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "b0929909933b8482b24db4b89319b77205347a60e45ee751f1078d3fdd4c4cd2",
      "translation_text_hash": "f3adf8f7c09974343a07ebd832dc645fe03824fcc34e27f32662b42388b6042e",
